window.products.push({"id":595043,"name":"ANG ® 3000/8000 Grit Combination Corundum Whetstone Knife Sharpening Stone 2-sided Sharpener with Non-slip Silicone Base","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xIx7jc1ML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Heathy life, happy cook! Have you ever suffered the embarrassment of hard cutting with dull knife that drives you crazy? This professional knife sharpener will definitely do you a favor! No hassle, try it now! USING INTRODUCTION: 1.Soak the stone in the water for 5 minutes, and then put it on a steady platform. 2.Sharpening the knives with one or two steps is decided by the degree of blunt tool. ✔Step 1: 3000 grit coarse grit, used to repair the seriously damaged edge, suitable for blunt knives.  Hold the knife at an angle of 10 - 30 °, grind the edge on the surface of stone back and forth with gentle pressure, and sharpen it until the edge sharp enough. After sharpening the tool, it needs to be honed with coarse grinding after half a year. Also depends on the specific situation.  ✔Step 2: 8000 grit fine grinding, a necessary step to eliminate burrs of the edge. Use more gentle pressure, repeat step 1, and repair the edge until smoothly and keenly.  General speaking, use it once a week to keep your blade sharp. 3.Please wipe it with wet cloth or rinse it with water after sharpening the tool, and then dry it. Clean the stone surface with a soft brush and put it in the air to make it dry. CAUTION: ★Please use the whole surface of stone to keep the consistency when sharpening knives. ★Protect the stone well and avoid it falling from the height. ★Please put the knife sharpener and knife beyond the reach of children to avoid any accidents. 30 Days Guarantee: Please check the product condition when you receive it, if it's damage, we will offer you money back or resend a new one; if you are not satisfied with this stone within 30 days after receiving, we will refund you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xIx7jc1ML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANG","source_asin":"B00QEZR07Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-595043","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00QEZR07Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00QEZR07Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
