window.products.push({"id":595050,"name":"SEI Furniture Southern Enterprises Cabrini Media Electric Fireplace 60\" Wide, White Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s7+6dCSLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stark white, sleek metal, and lifelike flames come together in this dynamic electric fireplace. Conveniently plug this fireplace into standard wall outlet with its 6' cord. Ample mantel space displays your TV while a spacious fixed shelf houses electronic accessories; two brushed glass doors conceal additional storage space for DVDs, books, or games. A contemporary styleis paired with nickel harwarde on this great item. In addition to that, it features 1 media shelf, 2 cabinets, with 1 adjustable shelf each. The firebox has realistic, multicolor flames and glowing embers with an interior brick design for a more lifelike look. Warm up entertaining in your home with this contemporary, dual duty fireplace. Energy efficient LED bulbs light the fire, a cost effective way to ignite bliss in any room without professional installation. The LED lights provide optional down light illumination. User friendly remote control offers 4-way adjustability to customize the fireplace from the comfort of your sofa. Remote control adjusts thermostat, timer, logs, and flames separately. Child safety lock is also accessible from remote control. Flames and logs each have 5-level adjustment, or off. An automatic shutoff and glass that remains cool to the touch ensure the fireplace warms safely. Safe, self-regulating heater turns off when desired temperature is met. Once powered off, logs and flames slowly turn down. Turn off the heat to enjoy the fireplace ambience year round! This wonderful fireplace accommodates a flat screen TV up to 58\" W overall and offers supplemental heat for up to 400 square feet (heats from 50 to 70 degrees in about 1 hour for a 14' x 14' x 8' room). Specifications: Temperature ratings: 62-82 degrees at 4 degree intervals; Heating/power: 120V/60Hz, 1500W, 12.5 Amps; Batteries: 1 CR2025, included. Dimensions include: Overall: 60\" W x 18.25\" D x 35.5\" H; ,Firebox front: 23\" W x 20\" H; Mantel: 59.75\" W x 17.5\" D; Media shelf: 51.25\" W x 9.75\" D x 5.5\" H; Cabinets: 15.5\" W x 15.25\" D x 21\" H; Adjustable shelves: 15.5\" W x 15.25\" D x 10\" H (adjust 2.5\" up/down); Clearance: 52.75\" W x 11.75\" D x 5.5\" H (support at center). This one-of-a-kind-item weighs approximately 113 lb. and supports up to 85 lb. (mantel), 30 lb. (media shelf), 15 lb. (adjustable shelves). Only quality materials and manufacturing will do. Materials: poplar, MDF, 4mm tempered glass, nickel, metal, resin, glass. Assembly required. Made in China.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s7+6dCSLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEI Furniture","source_asin":"B016VZZ3CM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-595050","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016VZZ3CM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016VZZ3CM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
