window.products.push({"id":595159,"name":"Rival CRZ575 Cool Zone Digital Deep Fryer, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41004M6GGQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Take the chore out of cooking your favorite foods with this convenient Rival deep fryer. Made of durable, stylish stainless steel, it features an extra-large 3-liter/12-cup oil capacity and Cool-Zone immersion heating for faster heat-up and restaurant style results. Adjustable temperature control provides a full range of temperatures, while the view window allows you to monitor the cooking without opening the lid. Cleanup is easy with the dishwasher safe lid, oil pot, housing and basket. As an added safety feature, the exclusive SureRelease power cord disconnects from the unit if the cord is pulled or tugged. Imported. 12Hx17Wx9D\". Amazon.com Deep-fried foods are usually something we eat at restaurants, partly because it seems like making them at home would be messy and complicated. But this restaurant-quality deep fryer means that making fried treats like French fries, onion rings, shrimp tempura, and doughnuts can easily be done in any home kitchen. The brushed steel housing with black accents has the look of a professional kitchen tool. There is a simple temperature knob, and a green ready light tells when the proper oil temperature has been reached. A view window in the lid helps with keeping an eye on what's frying inside. Safety features include non-skid feet, sturdy lid and side handles, an exterior housing that stays cool, and a magnetic cord that will detach if the machine is jostled, effectively shutting it down. It also has a filter in the lid that traps odor-causing smoke during cooking. The basket handle folds into the basket for more compact storage, and there's a basket rest for holding food up out of the oil while it's draining. A ticking kitchen timer rings to say that the food is done. The stainless steel oil reservoir detaches for easy cleaning and is dishwasher safe. The deep fryer measures 16 by 9 by 10 inches (unit is 21 inches long when 5-inch handle is extended). Rival includes a one-year warranty against defects and comes with a detailed booklet of instructions, recipes, and tips. --Garland Withers From the Manufacturer The diversified offering of Rival fryers will satisfy any deep-fryer enthusiast! From the original die-cast models, to the new cool-touch designs, families can now fry easily and safely. All Rival deep fryers are equipped with a SureRelease break-away cord system, which disconnects from the fryer when accidentally pulled or tugged. A polished stainless-steel exterior further establishes the Rival deep fryer as a perfect addition to any kitchen. See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41004M6GGQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rival","source_asin":"B00008KIWF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-595159","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00008KIWF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00008KIWF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
