window.products.push({"id":595288,"name":"Air Fryer Rack Accessories Compatible with Cosori, Dash, Chefman, Secura, Nuwave®, Emeril Lagasse, Philips, Cozyna + More, 5pcs Stainless Steel Air Fr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lJWwohnpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SOME COMPATIBLE MODELS – Chefman 2.6qt, Cosori 3.4qt and 3.7qt, Emeril Lagasse 6qt Power Air Fryer Pro, Dash 10 Liter, Philips Viva Collection, Secura 4.2qt, Cozyna 5.8qt Concord XL + MORE. (Infraovens is not affiliated with, or endorsed by, any of the brands mentioned here.) Please measure your basket for best results. COOK MORE FOOD AT THE SAME TIME – The stainless steel rack for air fryer helps you cook more food by allowing you to place food on top and bottom, creating a double layer. AVOID EXCESS OILS, FAT AND GREASE – The raised silicone mat allows food to be elevated so that extra oils, grease and fat drip away from the food while ensuring an even crisp. KEEP YOUR AIR FRYER CLEAN – The raised silicone mat has a wall along the edges that prevents residue from leaking into your air fryer. You can easily take it out without any oils dripping into your basket. The grilling mat also helps protect your baskets and racks. COOK SMALLER PIECES OF FOOD WITHOUT FALL OUT – Some smaller pieces of food such as chopped veggies and fries can easily fall out between the cracks. Use the mesh mat to hold all the pieces together for the best result.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lJWwohnpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INFRAOVENS","source_asin":"B07W9FLYRL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-595288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W9FLYRL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W9FLYRL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
