window.products.push({"id":595306,"name":"Back to basics Hand Grain mill (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.54,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gd8jo2FFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Designed with self-aligning, cast stainless-steel cone-shaped grinding burrs, the compact Back to Basics Grain Mill outperforms larger, heavier hand grinders. It is precision machined to ensure long life and smooth, even milling. The burrs adjust from fine to coarse grinding, which makes it ideal for a variety of grains like wheat, corn, rice, oats, and barley, as well as peppercorns, other dry spices, coffee, herbs, and even nuts. The grinder mounts easily to a countertop or table, secures with a clamping screw, and performs efficiently without the use of electricity. Fill the 2-1/4-cup grain hopper and turn the crank to grind. Overall, the grain mill measures 12 by 2 by 5 inches, with rubber pads to prevent scratching and marring. It stores easily in a drawer or cupboard and comes backed by a 2-year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gd8jo2FFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Back to Basics","source_asin":"B000PCDTNI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-595306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000PCDTNI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000PCDTNI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":595307,"name":"Wedding Gift for the Couple with Wedding Blessing Poem. Aspen Path Photo, 8x10 Double Matted. Wedding Keepsake for the Bride and Groom.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F0FhafkfL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"The anniversary couple will love this very special keepsake. It will be the gift they will cherish and display always. This beautiful photo of a lovely serene path surrounded by aspen trees includes the poem: May you always be warmed by each other's smile, always take time to walk and talk a while, always know deep down you're each other's best friend, and enjoy the kind of love that grows and knows no end. Thoughtful Keepsakes is an independently owned small business that takes pride in our products. The company was started by the owner, Penny, who photographs and designs all the products and now writes most of the poems. We give excellent customer service and a 100% satisfaction guarantee. The photo size is 5 1/2\" by 7 1/2\" and includes an 8\"x10\" double mat as viewed. Printed with high quality photo paper and ink. Unframed, No-frame included. Will fit in any 8\"x10\" frame that allows space for a double mat but not-a-photo-frame that fits only one piece of photo paper. To view all our gifts by category just click on \"Thoughtful Keepsakes\" (under “Add to Cart” button) and then click on our \"Products\" tab.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F0FhafkfL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anniversary & Wedding Gifts","source_asin":"B01IB3LLXW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-595307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IB3LLXW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IB3LLXW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":595308,"name":"Ultrasonic Mole Repellent, 8 Pack Solar Mole Repellent, Waterproof Gopher Sonic Device, Snake Gopher Vole Repellent for Garden & Yard","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T8geZXurL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DICITE Ultrasonic Solar-Powered Mole Repellent Protect Your Yard and Garden Solar Battery The mouse repellent is equiped with solar battery. Don't worry replace battery. Just place it in the sunlight for 4 hour, it can work 4 days continuously. Waterproof The solar mole repellent ultrasonic is 100% waterproof and made of high quality waterproof ABS plastic. So don't worry rain and snow. Wide Range The gopher repellent can cover 7000 square feet.It is recommended to place a gopher repellent every 50 feet in the affected area. How to install 1.Press on/off button to turn it on. 2.Insert the unit into the ground at least 8\" deep and keep 2\" above the soil. 2022 Upgrade Package includes: 8 x Square Solar Mole Repellent","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T8geZXurL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dicite","source_asin":"B0BF4MH49D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-595308","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF4MH49D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF4MH49D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
