window.products.push({"id":595322,"name":"2 Piece Knife Guide Layer Cake Leveling Tool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411y5SsJuFL._AC_.jpg","description":"This knife guide allows you to professionally level your cakes. Because they come in a set of 2 you can place 1 at the tip of the knife and 1 at the knife handle to cut wider cakes uniformly. No more lopsided or crooked cake layers with this tool measuring 5.5 by 4.1 by 2.5 centimeters (2.16 by 1.61 by 0.98 inches). With 5 different layer levels you can create your own designs in multiple thickness variations, just hold down the side button, place your knife in, with the blade out, and release the button to allow the spring hold the knife in place. Easily cut the cake to your preferences then, when finished, press the side buttons to take apart and clean with warm soapy water. Colors vary and are chosen at random.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411y5SsJuFL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Darion's World","source_asin":"B00S6SSN7A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-595322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00S6SSN7A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00S6SSN7A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
