window.products.push({"id":595409,"name":"Easy Tofu Press - Remove Water from Tofu in 10-20 Minutes, Vegan-Friendly Food Squeezer, Dishwasher Safe, Improve Tofu Taste, Includes Drip Tray, BPA-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619F2rLD0FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BPA Free & Dishwasher Safe, with Drip Tray. Large 8-12 oz Capacity! 𝟗𝟎-𝐃𝐚𝐲 𝐫𝐞𝐟𝐮𝐧𝐝 𝐩𝐨𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐲 & 𝟐-𝐘𝐞𝐚𝐫 𝐟𝐫𝐞𝐞 𝐫𝐞𝐩𝐥𝐚𝐜𝐞𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭, please feel free to reach out 𝐬𝐮𝐩𝐩𝐨𝐫𝐭@𝐭𝐨𝐩𝐫𝐞𝐬𝐬𝐞𝐫.𝐜𝐨𝐦 to extend your warranty. HASSLE-FREE TOFU PRESSING -- Hey there, are you a tofu lover like me? Then you know that when it comes to getting the most flavor out of your tofu, you need to press out that excess water. But let's be real, using plates and cans to do this is a messy hassle. EXTRACTS EXCESS WATER EFFICIENTLY -- That's where the Yarkor tofu press comes in! This bad boy takes all the work and mess out of pressing tofu (and other foods too!). With its internal spring, it'll extract all that extra water for you, leaving your tofu ready to absorb all those delicious spices and flavors. SET IT AND FORGET IT CONVENIENCE -- And the best part? You can set it and forget it! That's right, with the Yarkor press, you don't have to stand around holding plates or cans. You can move on to prepping other food, or even leave for the day, and come back to perfectly pressed tofu. MESS-FREE & TRANSPARENT DESIGN -- Plus, with its drainage holes and drip tray, you won't have to deal with any watery messes on your countertop. And the transparent design lets you keep an eye on just how much liquid has been removed. So say goodbye to the old, messy way of pressing tofu and hello to the Yarkor tofu press - the faster, easier, and more convenient way to get perfectly flavored tofu every time!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619F2rLD0FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YARKOR","source_asin":"B09F9DNMD8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-595409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F9DNMD8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F9DNMD8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":595410,"name":"Peugeot - Peugeot - Oleron Manual Dry Salt Mill - Transparent Adjustable Grinder - Acrylic and Beechwood, Chocolate, 5.5 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YDgkGgdQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Peugeot Mills, a combination of design and ingenuity Since 1840, Peugeot Mills have been an essential benchmark for gourmets and great chefs alike. They are exceptional pieces that have become tableware icons, from coffee mills to salt, pepper or spice grinders, manual or electric. Peugeot Mills are a pleasure to use with their sleek and elegant design, their noble indestructible materials, their range of shapes and colors, and their ever-more-innovative mechanisms, with a lifetime guarantee. A wide range of Peugeot Mills so you can get the best from each product All our mills are instruments of taste designed with a single goal: to extract the most perfect texture, grind and flavor possible, in the search for a delicious sensory experience. An aromatic journey through the world of the senses, an invitation to culinary excellence with a decidedly modern and contemporary approach, reflecting the perception of what is the French art of living today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YDgkGgdQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peugeot","source_asin":"B00TPGKASW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-595410","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00TPGKASW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00TPGKASW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":595411,"name":"Amy by Ines Kouidis Wall Decor, 18 by 24\" Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915zWv270XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a collage of images resembling Amy Winehouse. Ines Kouidis studied painting and drawing at the Free Academy of Art Berlin. In 2002 she founded her studio in Berlin and has been creating collages ever since from newsprint, magazines, posters and paper of any kind. Her works are included in private collections in Germany, UK, USA and the Netherlands. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915zWv270XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B014A5G6U8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-595411","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014A5G6U8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B014A5G6U8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":595412,"name":"Restaurantware Bio Tek 16 Ounce French Fry Containers, 100 Disposable Charcuterie Cups - Incline Design, Round, Kraft Paper French Fry Cups, Stackable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.73,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XhOTBdE7L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Serve all kinds of snacks using our Bio Tek 16-ounce Round Kraft Paper Incline Cups. These paper fry cups feature a greaseproof lining, allowing you to serve oily or greasy foods without worrying about them leaking through and creating messes. With a wide rim, these fry holders allow you to effortlessly scoop fries or onion rings from warmers and serve them to speed up your service time. Plus, the wide opening of these paper french fry cups gives customers easy access to their snacks so they can comfortably enjoy them while on the go. These paper french fry cups are sturdy and can stand on their own, allowing patrons to set them on tables while enjoying their meals. With a kraft finish, these recyclable french fry holders allow you to write down personalized notes and give food orders an eco-friendly look. These incline cups are conveniently stackable, allowing you to store them in your kitchen or storage room without taking up much space. Measuring 3.5 inches in diameter by 5.75 inches long, these fry cup holders contain up to 16 ounces. Sold in a 100 count box.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XhOTBdE7L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Restaurantware","source_asin":"B09J4G8W12","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-595412","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J4G8W12","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J4G8W12","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":595413,"name":"Emile Henry Le Potier 3-4/5-Quart Lasagna Baker, Crème","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31H6GGQ609L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Marcigny, a small town nestling between the hills of Southern Burgundy, has been home to Emile Henry for the past 150 years. Faithful to its origins, the entire production is carried out here. Thanks to its clay, rich in refractory properties, Burgundy has remained a fertile area for potters, passing on their savoir-faire from generation to generation. Clay, a natural and noble material, has been used since the mists of the time to cook or preserve food. While respecting the traditional techniques, Emile Henry has introduced technological improvements (Ceradon ®) so that the dishes are more resistant to mechanical and thermal shock. Strong, durable, all Emile Henry pieces can be taken directly from the freezer to the hot oven, can go under a broiler and is microwave, freezer and dishwasher safe. The natural clay is unsurpassed for conducting and retaining heat. All pieces are perfect for everyday use and carry a 3 year warranty against defects. Amazon.com Versatile in use and roomy enough for large households, this Emile Henry Le Potier baker is crafted for ideal baking results. Its 15-by-10-inch design holds 3.8 quarts, making it suitable for party-scale peach cobbler as well as main-dish lasagna. The weighty structure features 2-3/4-inch-deep sides, an attractive ribbed exterior, and tab handles. The design is handsome at the table, and the piece goes directly from the freezer to the oven for maximally efficient prep time. It is also safe in the microwave, broiler, and dishwasher. Dating back to 1850, Emile Henry has been crafting bakeware from high-fired premium Burgundy clay in France. The pieces are incredible durable, resistant to shock and temperature, and designed to heat both gently and evenly. A special surface treatment ensures that the glossy glaze is scratch-resistant and does not chip, crack, or craze under typical use. Each piece of bakeware or tableware is individually inspected, comes in a variety of fresh-looking colors, and includes a three-year warranty against defects. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31H6GGQ609L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emile Henry","source_asin":"B0001XKDDK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-595413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001XKDDK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001XKDDK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
