window.products.push({"id":595565,"name":"Handy Smoker PRO Cold Smoker - Hand Held Smoke Gun for Smoking Food - Smoke Infuser Adds Real Wood Smoked Flavor to Food & Drink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.74,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hXFe1kXuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Handy Smoker PRO food smoker is perfect for cold smoking meat, fish, vegetables, desserts, beverages and classic cocktails in seconds! Smaller and more versatile than a smoker grill, it's the perfect kitchen gadget for adding real wood smoky flavor and aroma to any dish or drink. No soaking wood chips or cooking foods for hours! Cold smoking gently infuses just the right amount of natural cool smoke to enhance flavors without cooking or preserving foods, or changing textures or temperatures. The Handy Smoker PRO features ultimate performance and a wider 1-inch 18/8 stainless steel top-loading wood chip cup that loads easily and holds more of your favorite flavor of wood chips. Our exclusive EASY handle design with integrated stand, and dual speed blower with thumb switch for COMFORT, allows anyone to easily adjust smoke intensity and duration. Battery-operated and portable for indoor use or outside. EXTRA LONG 24-inch nozzle extender hose for precise smoke application. Works with a variety of wood smoking chips, teas and spices, Hay, dried flowers, and herbs. Approved for commercial use, professional chef, home kitchen, backyard bbq, and mixologists. Great for bars and restaurants, too! Smoke Salmon after Plating, serve smoked bbq meats, cheese or butters, cherry tomatoes for salads, sauces, chocolate, meringues and fruits in a flash. Easily elevate bartender recipes to exciting smoky cocktails, like smoky Marini, smoky Mary and dragon's breath. Simply add a pinch of chips or spices to the cup, ignite with a wooden match or lighter, and apply the smoke. Includes 4 extra smoke screens, 1/2-ounce of real apple wood chips, complete instructions, and our exclusive 100% Customer Satisfaction Guarantee! Wipes clean with a damp cloth. Removable burn bowl and detachable stainless steel barrel are dishwasher safe for easy cleanup.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hXFe1kXuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Handy Smoker","source_asin":"B07H22WNZL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-595565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H22WNZL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H22WNZL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
