window.products.push({"id":595632,"name":"Peacock Alley Emma Printed Sateen Sheet Set | 100% Long Staple Cotton | 300 Thread-Count | Soft and Smooth Sateen Weave | 5 Color Options (Blue, King ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hdjWPUfvL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","description":"The beautiful and luxurious Emma Printed Sateen Sheet Set is in White with a Blue diamond print and satin accent embroidered trim. This is the perfect look to complement any room. The King Set includes 1 flat sheet, 1 fitted sheet with a 17” gusset to get that perfect fit and 2 pillowcases. Our Peacock Alley sheets are manufactured with 100% extra long-staple cotton for a quality you can see and feel and have an incredible 300 thread count which provide the supreme quality and soft buttery feel to enjoy a great sleep. The Emma is imported from Portugal for a quality product you can enjoy for years. Care instructions: Machine wash cold, gentle cycle. Do not mix colors, do not bleach or use fabric softener. Tumble dry low, remove promptly. Warm iron, if needed. May be professionally cleaned. Please refrain from using bleach or other harmful chemicals and detergents on fine linens. Peacock Alley has been a name synonymous with luxury, high quality linens since 1973. We source fabric from the finest, most responsible mills around the world - most notably in Portugal - and having them sewn in our Dallas, Texas workshop by skilled, local artisans to create the perfect linens for you and your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hdjWPUfvL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peacock Alley","source_asin":"B08BWWWYZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-595632","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BWWWYZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BWWWYZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
