window.products.push({"id":595710,"name":"Handheld Vacuum, Hand Vacuum Cordless Portable Vacuum Cleaner with Li-ion Battery Rechargeable Quick Charge Tech, 2 LED Light Wet Dry Car Vacuum for H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BxId1JmqS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Powerful Cyclonic Suction】Cordless handheld vacuum equipped with 100W ultra-high power motor with suction up to 5.5Kpa. Good for daily cleaning, including hairs, dust, pet hair and paper debris. An excellent choice for both car cleaning and home cleaning (wet-dry double use). It provides an all-around protection for your family. After cleaning the filter, please make sure to dry it before use. Ideal gift for Christmas. 【Quick Recharging &Multiple Protection】Portable vacuum cleaner can fully charge the battery within 3-4 hours, and the continuous using time is up to 30 minutes. Our charging system also provides over-voltage protection, over-current protection, over-temperture protection to make sure it is safe. 【4 IN 1 Versatility&Widely Used】 Car vacuum cordless comes with 4 accessories, including a crevice nozzle for narrow gaps&corners, a brush tool for carpet and hair, a soft long tube for dust particles flexibly and pet brush for Pet hair. No matter in home, office or car, you will always find it easy to clean up. 【Washable Stainless Steel Filter】Stainless steel filter comes with dual Filtration. The filtration system is denser than ordinary filters. Each stainless steel filter can be washed 1000 times. It is equivalent to about 40 HEPA filters and is a popular model with high power to absorb fine particles. After cleaning the filter, please make sure to dry it before use, because water molecules will clog the filter mesh, then the suction power will be affected. 【LED Light & Lower Noise】Handle vacuum has 2-LED lights can be easily cleaned even in dark places. The car vacuum cleaner could lower the sound to 70db when it works. It has a strong suction while keeping the bass running, providing your family with a quiet cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BxId1JmqS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TowerTop","source_asin":"B07XP8S3LX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-595710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XP8S3LX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XP8S3LX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
