window.products.push({"id":595747,"name":"KNOBWELL 2 Pack Empyrean Grace Golden Curtain Rod, 22-42 in, Brass Single Rod with Ball Finials, 1\" Single Rod Window Treatment Rod Drapery Rod","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KFaDSYV7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DECORATIVE ROD: This KNOBWELL Curtain Rod features brass rod and unique lantern finials, visually cool and noble, matches windows of multiple styles; Finial Diameter: 2-1/2\". TELESCOPING STRUCTURE: 1 inch diameter telescoping curtain rod can adjust from 22-42 inches to accommodate your window. Great for grommet, back tab, rod pocket and tab top curtains. PROJECTIONS: Roughtly 3-3/10 inch from the wall, decortative elegant finials on either end provide a visually balanced appearance. MULTIPLE USES: Ideal for use with light, medium weight or heavy curtains max. 22 lbs in your bedroom, living room, kitchen and dining room. (Each rod should be used with two pieces of curtains.) EASY INSTALLATION: With inside mounting hardware and installation instruction you can mount these curtain rods easily on the wall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KFaDSYV7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KNOBWELL","source_asin":"B08GCKVKMY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-595747","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GCKVKMY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GCKVKMY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":595748,"name":"Palais Glassware Clear Glass Beverage Dispenser with Bail & Trigger Locking Lid - 2 Gallon ('Sweet Tea' Embossed)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51glc+b2CXL._AC_.jpg","description":"From sweet tea and freshly-squeezed lemonade to fruit punch and ice water, this 1 gallon mason jar clear glass beverage dispenser makes serving eye-catching refreshments effortless! This elegant dispenser is made of crystal glass, great for showcasing your most colorful or fruit filled beverages. This tried-and-true classic look is incredibly versatile, making it ideal for both casual and formal occasions. It is the perfect self-serve tabletop addition to you catering service, restaurant, breakfast bar, and so much more! The stylish glass dispenser is capable of holding 2 gallon of your favorite refreshments, simultaneously enhancing your decor and conserving table space. The mason jar-style top is simple to remove, making this beverage dispenser easy to fill and refill. The metal latch on the lid also gives the beverage dispenser a nice seal when in use, keeping your drinks fresh while helping to prevent spills during transport. The sleek silver spout on this non-insulated dispenser allows for easy dispensing so your guests or patrons can conveniently serve themselves. Use this beautiful piece as part of your rustic wedding reception decor, or use it to enhance the buffet tabletops at your establishment - no matter what the venue, this clear glass beverage dispenser will serve your refreshments in style! To ensure long term usability, this dispenser should be hand washed and is not recommended for use in conventional or microwave ovens.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51glc+b2CXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Palais Glassware","source_asin":"B00YW0L9M2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-595748","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YW0L9M2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YW0L9M2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
