window.products.push({"id":595797,"name":"Greaton, 6 to 9 Inch Ultra Soft-Premium Zippered Mattress Protector Cover, Water Proof, Breathable and noiseless, Twin, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.76,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RRVoz23GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A mattress protector is a type of bedding accessory designed to provide an additional layer of protection to your mattress. It typically covers the all sides of the mattress, and is usually made of a soft, breathable fabric. Mattress protectors also include a water-resistant layer Mattress protectors are typically available in a range of sizes to fit different mattress depths. The most common sizes are 6\" to 9\" depth and 10\" to 14\" depth. It's important to measure the depth of your mattress before purchasing a protector to ensure that you choose the correct size. A protector that is too small may not provide adequate coverage, while a protector that is too large may not fit securely and could shift or bunch up during the night. Choosing the right size protector can help ensure that your mattress is fully protected and that you can enjoy a comfortable and uninterrupted night's sleep. Mattress protectors come with a zipper closure, which makes them even easier to use and maintain. With a zippered cover, you can easily remove the protector from your mattress for washing or cleaning, without having to fuss with elastic straps or other attachments. This can save you time and effort, and also help ensure that the protector stays securely in place when it's on your mattress. Additionally, a zippered cover can help keep your mattress protector clean and hygienic, as it can be fully removed and washed as needed. Mattress protector is an effective way to protect your mattress investment and maintain the hygiene of your sleeping environment. They can help extend the life of your mattress, improve the quality of your sleep, and make it easier to keep your bedding clean and fresh.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RRVoz23GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Greaton","source_asin":"B0C6N1R61X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-595797","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6N1R61X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6N1R61X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
