window.products.push({"id":595890,"name":"Piper Cherokee 140 PA-28-140 Qref Checklist Card","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.64,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pM4sAFApL._AC_.jpg","description":"Even as relatively simple to operate as the Piper 140 is, most will agree that its manufacturer-produced checklists leave plenty of room for improvement. Fortunately, the experts at Qref have picked up the slack and developed these crystal-clear, concise-yet-comprehensive PA-28-140 checklists that'll have you aviating like a pro every time you enter the cockpit. Unlike the decades-old factory-provided equivalent, which - at times - presents info that's a bit scant, confusing, or otherwise just doesn't follow a logical, efficient flow, the Qref alternative supports smooth, streamlined execution and constant situational awareness the entire time you're at the controls. Qref's staff of Master CFIs have pooled their over 40 years of active industry experience to develop these Cherokee 140-specific reference cards that promote industry best practices throughout every phase of operation.The Normal Procedures (blue-accented) card conveniently lists ALL Cherokee 140 V-speeds in both MPH and knots, and - in addition to covering every flight phase from preflight to shutdown/tiedown - presents info on tire, oil, and fuel specifics; as well as appropriately placed wing flap operational parameters. The Emergency Procedures (red-accented) checklist addresses such critical developments as engine failures, cabin/engine/electrical fires, emergency descent, propeller/power problems, and much more. It also features handy rulers for both Sectional and TAC chart scales. Both 5\" x 9\" (12.7 cm x 22.8 cm), kneeboard/yoke-friendly cards are water resistant, tear resistant, and UV coated so they won't fade. They also foster both sunlight and red-light readability, and their 15 MIL low-gloss lamination makes the cards ideal for annotation with dry-erase markers. The checklists are applicable to PA-28-140 models manufactured from 1964-77. They also make outstanding supplements to the Piper PA-28-140 Cherokee 140 Qref Book Aircraft Procedure Checklist (sold separately). An intuitive, reliable,","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pM4sAFApL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qref","source_asin":"B00J0OZSRM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-595890","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00J0OZSRM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00J0OZSRM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
